cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-terminal"
abstract: >-
  A streaming trading terminal built on the Wickra core: one data-driven core
  exposed in ten languages, with a native TUI and a Web front-end as two renderers
  over it. Panels emit view-models, so one core drives every front-end, and 497 of
  the Wickra indicators are constructible by name from a config or at run time.
type: software
authors:
